{
  "video_id": "5Os5EV1YHtY",
  "title": "I Asked Claude To Apply To 100 Jobs For Me",
  "description": "Most applications are filtered by software before a human reads them. If the exact words from the advert are not in your CV, you are cut. That makes job hunting a matching problem and a volume problem, which is exactly what AI is good at.\n\nThe system: upload your CV and have Claude work like a senior recruiter to find the 20 roles you actually qualify for and the words the screening software scans for. Turn your CV into one master template. Add the Claude for Chrome extension so it can use a browser. Build a match scored shortlist from LinkedIn and Indeed. Then let it fill in applications with your approval on every submit.\n\nHonest limits: it cannot solve CAPTCHAs, some sites block automation, and it must never invent experience.\n\nGet every prompt here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12ttLyEGCeEPZdE7yao5r96DJjR0ucia2kimytHJBUp8/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #JobSearch",
  "publishedAt": "2026-08-21T20:00:28Z",
  "channel_name": "Sebastian Hardy | AI Marketing",
  "transcript": "Most applications are filtered by software before a human reads them. If the exact words from the advert are not in your CV, you are cut. That makes job hunting a matching problem and a volume problem, which is exactly what AI is good at.\n\nThe system: upload your CV and have Claude work like a senior recruiter to find the 20 roles you actually qualify for and the words the screening software scans for. Turn your CV into one master template. Add the Claude for Chrome extension so it can use a browser. Build a match scored shortlist from LinkedIn and Indeed. Then let it fill in applications with your approval on every submit.\n\nHonest limits: it cannot solve CAPTCHAs, some sites block automation, and it must never invent experience.\n\nGet every prompt here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12ttLyEGCeEPZdE7yao5r96DJjR0ucia2kimytHJBUp8/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #JobSearch",
